<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Continual Darkness</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Necromancer (guild level 14), Dark Knight (guild level 41)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast continual darkness &lt;object&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast continual darkness</a>   (on the room you are in)
</pre>
<p>The opposite of continual light: an object, or the room you stand in, is 
plunged into darkness, twice as deep as the darkness spell, and it doesn't 
wear off: the darkness stays. Cast it on something you carry, and the shadow 
goes where you go.
</p><p>It doesn't add up with the darkness spell: something already darkened by 
either one can't be darkened again. You must be standing. It is also found on 
staffs, scrolls and wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Darkness</a>
